@base = http://localhost:5080/api/produtos

### 1) Criar
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Teclado mecânico", "preco": 349.90 }

### 2) Criar inválido
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "TV", "preco": 0 }

### 3) Listar
GET {{base}}

### 4) Buscar existente
GET {{base}}/1

### 5) Buscar inexistente
GET {{base}}/999

### 6) Atualizar existente
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Teclado gamer", "preco": 399.90 }

### 7) Atualizar inexistente
PUT {{base}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Teclado gamer", "preco": 399.90 }

### 8) Remover
DELETE {{base}}/1

### 9) Remover de novo
DELETE {{base}}/1